地，整顿备荒事务", "description": "正统五年七月辛丑，明廷派刑部侍郎何文渊等分赴各地，整顿预防灾荒的事务。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年七月辛丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "b1a5f5ae-cea5-5365-8d31-a31fedc46fbd"}, {"title": "杨荣在返回朝廷途中去世", "description": "正統5年（1440年）七月，杨荣在返回朝廷途中去世。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正統5年（1440年）七月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "5e1a15ce-0382-59b0-b7ee-a545d604ca16"}, {"title": "明廷命各边地整备救荒措施", "description": "正统五年八月乙未，朝廷下令各地边镇完善灾荒防备与救济。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年八月乙未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3dc42a6b-93cb-54f4-82cf-9132a09838df"}, {"title": "明廷豁免云南积欠的赋税", "description": "正统五年九月壬寅，朝廷免除云南积欠的赋税。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年九月壬寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "f2dd78e6-d996-56c8-a454-fd8e0c913714"}, {"title": "明廷赈济浙江饥民", "description": "正统五年十一月壬寅，朝廷救济浙江的饥民。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年十一月壬寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "154b2ac0-11fe-59a0-a5fe-522d86743da4"}, {"title": "明廷减免苏州等六地水灾所涉税粮", "description": "正统五年十一月壬子，朝廷免除苏州、松江、常州、镇江、嘉兴、湖州水灾所涉的税粮。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年十一月壬子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "084dfbbc-14dd-5579-b511-185e5a046119"}, {"title": "自称建文帝的广西僧人杨行祥被押送京师，死于狱中", "description": "正统五年十一月丁巳，《明史》本纪将广西僧人杨行祥自称建文帝记为冒称。杨行祥被押往京师，关进锦衣卫监狱后身亡。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年十一月丁巳", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "dda0a6bd-775b-557d-a5bb-2e43680d2afd"}, {"title": "本纪记沐昂率部平息师宗战事", "description": "正统五年十一月乙丑，本纪记载沐昂率部平息师宗一带与明廷的战事。", "start_year": 1440, "end_year": 1440, "time_original": "正统五年十一月乙丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ef8519d9-a53f-5498-8926-57fd1ddf601b"}, {"title": "明廷减免南畿和浙鲁豫受灾地区税粮", "description": "正统五年十二月壬午，朝廷免除南畿、浙江、山东、河南受灾地区应缴的税粮。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统五年十二月壬午", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "c140f504-03a2-566b-8757-c55f16a08896"}, {"title": "本纪汇记正统五年各地进贡", "description": "正统五年，占城、琉球中山、哈密和乌斯藏入贡。 按原历纪年，事情发生在公元1440至1441年之间。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "正统五年", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ddd7a686-b887-5b69-a713-290834e7b195"}, {"title": "本纪记应有日食而未见，明英宗未准庆贺", "description": "正统六年正月初一，本纪记按预期应当有日食，当天未能看见。礼官请求上表庆贺，明英宗未准。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年正月己亥朔", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "e3cdbdb7-ceb0-5686-9ca2-6622499556ac"}, {"title": "明英宗在南郊祭祀天地", "description": "正统六年正月庚戌，明英宗朱祁镇在南郊举行祭祀天地的大典。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年正月庚戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3b10ca53-f36d-5e5f-ae52-a0e4e51fdeac"}, {"title": "明英宗因庄浪多次地震祭祀郊庙，并遣使祭西方岳镇", "description": "正统六年正月乙卯，因庄浪多次地震，明英宗朱祁镇亲自赴郊庙祭祀，又派使者祭祀西方岳镇。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年正月乙卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "f1eb6fbc-79be-5c79-b335-8679ee8a4fa1"}, {"title": "王骥总督军务", "description": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）二月，王骥总督军务。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）二月；公元年核为1441年。", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "02522adc-8c26-5bbb-b9e3-5f53edc166bb"}, {"title": "兵部侍郎于谦被下狱", "description": "正统六年三月庚子，明廷将兵部侍郎于谦关入监狱。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年三月庚子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "aabb07ff-d92a-5377-bff0-b19ea4057954"}, {"title": "明廷因灾异派使者复查各地疑案", "description": "正统六年四月甲午，朝廷因灾异派使者赴各地复查疑难案件。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年四月甲午", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "024c21f6-2805-5df5-8fc7-2547e36decba"}, {"title": "何文渊等分别审录京师与南京刑狱", "description": "正统六年五月甲寅，朝廷派何文渊、王文审录京师刑狱，由周忱、郭瑾审录南京刑狱。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年五月甲寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "397c03d9-11e2-5ca4-96db-3f43476b7f93"}, {"title": "于谦获释后出任大理少卿", "description": "正统六年五月，明廷释放此前入狱的于谦，任命他为大理少卿。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年五月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "d6b39013-1dbd-5aab-8692-b61108f88e55"}, {"title": "明廷赈济浙江和湖广饥民", "description": "正统六年七月丁未，朝廷救济浙江和湖广的饥民。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年七月丁未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "80b7e934-a314-56eb-a59c-1f9638e8c934"}, {"title": "刘中敷入狱并戴上刑具，不久恢复原职", "description": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）十月，刘中敷入狱并戴上刑具，不久恢复原职。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）十月；公元年核为1441年。", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9402d31f-4288-5274-8e9f-c2d2ee16882d"}, {"title": "明廷豁免京畿灾区税粮", "description": "正统六年十月庚寅，朝廷豁免京畿受灾地区的税粮。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年十月庚寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "da9522ee-5a30-5cc5-90d5-94eb760238c0"}, {"title": "明廷定都北京，各官署停止使用行在称谓", "description": "正统六年十一月初一，乾清、坤宁二宫与奉天、华盖、谨身三殿建成，朝廷大赦。明廷定都北京，文武官署停止沿用「行在」的称谓。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年十一月甲午朔", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "aa0e4ed1-1581-5514-9c5d-03344b5f3587"}, {"title": "王骥所率明军攻下麓川上江寨", "description": "正统六年十一月癸卯，王骥所率明军攻克麓川上江寨。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年十一月癸卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3df65d35-c814-5e1c-a9ea-fe9d99165caf"}, {"title": "明廷减免河南、山东和凤阳等地灾区税粮", "description": "正统六年十一月癸丑，朝廷免除河南、山东和凤阳等地受灾地区所涉的税粮。", "start_year": 1441, "end_year": 1441, "time_original": "正统六年十一月癸丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "2274b7b2-c9ae-5100-a7f4-f52b92cecb6b"}, {"title": "刘中敷再次被投入监狱", "description": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）闰十一月，刘中敷再次被投入监狱。原历日期只能确定在公元1441年至1442年之间，保留发生范围。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "正统6年（年号对照1441年）闰十一月；发生于公元1441至1442年之间，原文未标具体日。", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "8494cfb7-dce6-574c-ac84-f87847518277"}, {"title": "明军攻克麓川，思任发退往孟养", "description": "正统六年十二月，王骥所部攻克麓川，思任发撤往孟养。", "start_year": 1442, "end_year": 1442, "time_original": "正统六年十二月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3d847176-8fb2-51ef-8901-5aaa29313e53"}, {"title": "征麓川明军班师", "description": "正统六年十二月丁未，明军自麓川班师。", "start_year": 1442, "end_year": 1442, "time_original": "正统六年十二月丁未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "8073cab2-d5c9-5169-a168-e6d15b4a99dc"}, {"title": "李安在高黎贡山进攻麓川余部失利", "description": "正统六年十二月，左副总兵李安在高黎贡山进攻仍与明廷交战的麓川余部，战事失利。", "start_year": 1442, "end_year": 1442, "time_original": "正统六年十二月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "11322fbd-54c4-5f25-acdd-3dbcbb881ff8"}, {"title": "本纪汇记正统六年各地进贡", "description": "正统六年，占城、瓦剌和哈密入贡。 按原历纪年，事情发生在公元1441至1442年之间。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "正统六年", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "36eb8d75-0fbd-5517-a737-d63adf4f907b"}, {"title": "刘中敷获释为民，吴玺和陈瑺被发往边地", "description": "据卷十本纪，三人再次被下狱后，刘中敷于下一年获释为民，吴玺和陈瑺被发往边地戍守。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "正统六年闰十一月再下狱之后，原文称逾年", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "1f0e5d6f-f762-5dd5-97c5-f10a84eadbd5"}]'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

